      "value": "@{5adfa711a8ca626f7bf243ae|full_name}: Do you have a source for that claim? When I read the code in UpdateParticles1(), it's starting the loop from 0 but it's clearly skipping the root bone because p.m_ParentIndex would be 0. In UpdateParticles2(), it's starting the loop from 1. In SkipUpdateParticles, it's starting the loop from 0 but again it's skipping the root bone.\n\nCan you point to a line of code where it doesn't?",
      "viewerReactions": null
